        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "These are the protections we built into Claude Duet for working across your accounts and acting on your behalf.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
