      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "• • • • • • • • • Claude Duet Safety, Privacy, and Security | Claude by Anthropic • •",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Skip to main content Claude Duet (opens in new tab) is an agent, currently in research preview, that uses a cloud-based computer to do work for you.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In 2025 we published our framework for safe and trustworthy agents (opens in new tab) , which puts people in control and treats privacy and secure interactions as basic requirements.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We also build and operate the infrastructure businesses use to run agents in production through Claude Managed Agents (opens in new tab) , and Claude Duet keeps credentials separate from the agent in the same way.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A separate, automated check runs alongside each action, built on the auto mode classifier from Claude Code (opens in new tab) and extended for Claude Duet.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To address this, we built a new safety classifier that runs separately from the main model and checks whether each message Claude Duet is about to send contains potentially sensitive information.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Duet is still in research preview and these safeguards will occasionally miss something or flag a harmless message.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The apps you have connected to Claude carry over to Claude Duet, and switching an app off in one place switches it off in both.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Duet also uses the memory from your Claude account, so details Claude remembered from your earlier chats are visible.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Soon you will also be able to sign in with 1Password; Claude Duet will ask for a credential, you will approve that request in 1Password, and the credential will go to the browser without passing through the model.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When Claude Duet works in a connected app, it follows our Claude Managed Agents design (opens in new tab) so credentials stay out of reach of the agent’s work.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Before launch, we also contacted several large websites and gave them the option to prevent Claude Duet from visiting their sites, and some chose to.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet-safety-privacy-and-security",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:24.720Z"
      }
